{"id":"word:hebrew:H8433","type":"word","title":"תּוֹכֵחָה","subtitle":"H8433 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"chastisement ; figuratively (by words) correction , refutation , proof (even in defence)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תּוֹכֵחָה (H8433) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 28 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תּוֹכֵחָה (tôwkêchâh) means chastisement ; figuratively (by words) correction , refutation , proof (even in defence) First listed occurrence: 2Kgs 19 3."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תּוֹכֵחָה","transliteration":"tôwkêchâh","pronunciation":"to-kay-khaw'","strong":"H8433","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8433","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["תּוֹכַ֣חַת","וְ/תוֹכֵחָ֛ה","תּוֹכַחְתִּֽ/י","וְ֝/תוֹכַחְתִּ֗/י","תוֹכַ֣חַת"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",8],["HC/Ncfsa",4],["HNcfpa",4],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",3],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp1cs",2],["HC/R/Ncfpc",1],["HR/Ncfpc",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cs",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1],["HNcfpc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"chastisement ; figuratively (by words) correction , refutation , proof (even in defence)","usage":"argument, × chastened, correction, reasoning, rebuke, reproof, × be (often) reproved.","full":"H8433. towkechah תּוֺכֵחָה noun feminine rebuke, correction ; — ת׳יום Hosea 5:9 ; ות צרה ׳יום 2Kin 19:3 = Isa 37:3 ; plural תּוֺכֵחוֺת Psa 149:7 (|| נקמה ). תּוֺכַ֫חַת noun feminine argument, reproof ; — ׳ת Prov 10:17 9 t.; suffix תּוֺכַחְתִּי Hab 2:1 5 t.; תּוֺכַחְתּוֺ Prov 3:11 ; plural תּוֺכָחוֺת Psa 38:15 3 t.; construct תּוֺכְחוֺת Prov 6:23 ; Ezek 25:17 ; תֹּכְחוֺת 5:15 (but latter strike out Co; given by SS under תּוֺכֵחָה ); — 1 argument, impeachment , spoken by lips and mouth Psa 38:15 ; Job 13:6 ; 23:4 ; Hab 2:1 . 2 reproof, chiding Prov 1:23 ; 27:5 ; || עצה 1:25 , 30 ; || מוסר 3:11 ; 5:12 ; 10:17 ; 12:1 ; 13:18 ; 15:5 , 10 , 32 ; ׳ת מוסר 6:23 reporoofs for discipline ; ׳ת חיים 15:31 reproof that giveth life ; תוכחוֺת אישׁ 29:1 man of reproofs (who deserves them). 3 correction, rebuke Psa 39:12 ; 73:14 ; ׳ות שֵׁבֶט Prov 29:15 ; ׳תּ חֵמָה Ezek 5:15 ; 25:17 .","rootNote":"and תּוֹכַחַת ; from 3198 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Kgs 19 3","keyReferences":["2Kgs 19 3","Ezek 5 15","Ezek 25 17","Hab 2 1","Hos 5 9","Isa 37 3","Job 13 6","Job 23 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":28,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Kgs 19 3","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תוֹכֵחָ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 5 15","book":"Ezek","chapter":5,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְ/תֹכְח֣וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfpc"},{"reference":"Ezek 25 17","book":"Ezek","chapter":25,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/תוֹכְח֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfpc"},{"reference":"Hab 2 1","book":"Hab","chapter":2,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תּוֹכַחְתִּֽ/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Hos 5 9","book":"Hos","chapter":5,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תּֽוֹכֵחָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Isa 37 3","book":"Isa","chapter":37,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תוֹכֵחָ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Job 13 6","book":"Job","chapter":13,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תוֹכַחְתִּ֑/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Job 23 4","book":"Job","chapter":23,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תוֹכָחֽוֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"Prov 1 23","book":"Prov","chapter":1,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְֽ/ת֫וֹכַחְתִּ֥/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Prov 1 25","book":"Prov","chapter":1,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ֝/תוֹכַחְתִּ֗/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp1cs